== Trivia ==
* His behavior and appearance is reminiscent to that of {{e|Pin}}, and is a variant of it.
* When encountered in the {{s|Dross}}, the color palette of Wormwood and his attacks are altered to fit the floor. {{e|Lil Blub}} also features this.
* His name is a reference to the Biblical [[wikipedia:Wormwood (Bible)|Wormwood]]. It is a star that, according to the [[wikipedia:Book of Revelation|Book of Revelation]], will fall on a third of the Earth's water, which will turn the water bitter and deadly to drink.
* In the ''Antibirth'' mod, Wormwood could be encountered as a degraded boss in the {{s|Corpse}}, and would take on a red color palette.
** The red color palette is still present in the files of Repentance, despite going unused.

